{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 65,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9635009765625,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "groups. There is therefore a need for improved diagnostic approaches to accurately confirm",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        436.115234375,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "TB in these higher-risk populations to ensure early and effective treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        526.9589233398438,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "Tests based on the detection of the lipoarabinomannan (LAM) antigen are biomarker-based",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.9700927734375,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "tests that may be used on urine at the point of care for TB detection. The currently available",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        526.9110107421875,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "urinary LAM assay is rapid (<1 hour to result) but has suboptimal sensitivity and is therefore not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976675033569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        526.9920043945312,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "suitable as general diagnostic tests for TB. However, unlike traditional diagnostic methods, it",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        527.0031127929688,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "demonstrates improved sensitivity for the diagnosis of TB among individuals coinfected with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        526.9699096679688,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "HIV. The estimated sensitivity is even greater in patients with low CD4 cell counts. The lateral",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        526.7522583007812,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "flow urine LAM assay (LF-LAM) strip-test – the Abbott/Alere Determine TB LAM Ag (USA),",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.16522216796875,
        524.4139404296875,
        230.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "hereafter referred to as LF-LAM – is currently the only commercially available urinary LAM test.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996349334716797,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.14956665039062,
        527.0938720703125,
        254.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "10  Using concurrent testing of different sample types offers a promising approach that considers",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974821090698242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.66912841796875,
        526.9974975585938,
        269.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "the diagnostic testing barriers for HIV-positive adults and adolescents, HIV-positive children,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.16912841796875,
        526.9041748046875,
        285.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "and children without HIV or for whom HIV status is unknown. For instance, testing of sputum",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.66912841796875,
        527.0140380859375,
        300.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "and stool during the same visit, when feasible, using LC-aNAATs increases the likelihood of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.16912841796875,
        526.9811401367188,
        316.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "detecting TB in children who may have scant bacilli in respiratory samples alone. Similarly, for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.66912841796875,
        526.9369506835938,
        331.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "persons living with HIV, testing of sputum and urine during the same visit, when sputum can",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.1690979003906,
        526.8379516601562,
        347.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "be produced, using LC-aNAATs and LF-LAM increases the likelihood of detecting TB with a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.6690979003906,
        526.9926147460938,
        362.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "rapid point-of-care result while also ensuring detection of rifampicin resistance. This concurrent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.960428237915039,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.1690979003906,
        527.0469970703125,
        378.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "testing approach builds on the prior recommendation for LF-LAM test use among eligible",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.6690979003906,
        526.6146850585938,
        393.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "persons living with HIV, which underscored the need for mWRD testing of available respiratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979480743408203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.1690979003906,
        425.852294921875,
        409.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "samples to support universal patient access to resistance testing services.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.1730041503906,
        526.9590454101562,
        438.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "Implementing a diagnostic approach that includes concurrent sample testing could simplify",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.6730041503906,
        526.9260864257812,
        453.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic processes, shorten the patient journey, and improve TB detection rates and health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        456.1730041503906,
        526.9963989257812,
        469.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "outcomes for these at-risk populations. At the same time, the inability to collect one or more",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.6730041503906,
        527.0305786132812,
        484.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "specimens at the same initial visit, or lack of one of the two test types should not delay testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.1730041503906,
        526.968994140625,
        500.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "of available specimens and tests, but instead trigger specimen collection and testing as soon",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.6729736328125,
        126.21800231933594,
        515.8179931640625
      ],
      "text": "as possible.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.6729736328125,
        323.2800598144531,
        534.8179931640625
      ],
      "text": "The following three scenarios of recommendations:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.425048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        554.570068359375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        541.425048828125,
        526.9797973632812,
        554.570068359375
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAAT on respiratory samples and urine LF-LAM among adults and adolescents living",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        556.925048828125,
        127.31240844726562,
        570.070068359375
      ],
      "text": "with HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.425048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        585.570068359375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        572.425048828125,
        350.9643249511719,
        585.570068359375
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAAT on respiratory samples and stool in children",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.9249877929688,
        78.81909942626953,
        601.0700073242188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        587.9249877929688,
        527.1016845703125,
        601.0700073242188
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAAT on respiratory samples and stool, as well as urinary LF-LAM among children with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998700141906738,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        603.4249877929688,
        102.60639953613281,
        616.5700073242188
      ],
      "text": "HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.2634887695312,
        527.1239624023438,
        643.4085083007812
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations should be implemented within recommendations for the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.7634887695312,
        479.2357482910156,
        658.9085083007812
      ],
      "text": "comprehensive diagnosis and management of persons living with HIV and children.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.1837158203125,
        526.2899780273438,
        761.9436645507812
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent use of tests: samples are taken simultaneously (when possible), and testing is conducted for both tests. A positive  10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        763.3836669921875,
        290.9746398925781,
        772.9436645507812
      ],
      "text": "result on either test is a positive result for the combination.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 49",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}